        "original_id": "a954e88c-bac4-5cfa-9483-29ece4368411",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Publications: The New York Times Fiction Best Seller list\n- Books: Camino Island, The Shack\n- People: John Grisham, William P. Young\n- Topics: 2017 adult fiction best sellers\n\nFacts:\n- The Shack is a novel by Canadian author William P. Young that was published in 2007.\n- In 2017, The New York Times Fiction Best Seller list tracked adult fiction books in the Combined Print & E-Book Fiction category.\n- In 2017, Camino Island by John Grisham was the most frequent weekly number-one book on The New York Times Fiction Best Seller list with 5 weeks at the top.\n- In 2017, The Shack by William P. Young was the second most frequent weekly number-one book on The New York Times Fiction Best Seller list with 4 weeks at the top.",
